      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    quarterly_returns = [5, 3, 8, 2, 7, 3, 6, 4, 5, 7, 6, 4]\n    lag = 1\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    mean_return = sum(quarterly_returns) / len(quarterly_returns)\n\n    numerator = sum(\n        (quarterly_returns[i] - mean_return)\n        * (quarterly_returns[i - lag] - mean_return)\n        for i in range(lag, len(quarterly_returns))\n    )\n\n    denominator = sum(\n        (return_value - mean_return) ** 2\n        for return_value in quarterly_returns\n    )\n\n    autocorrelation = numerator / denominator\n    answer = round(autocorrelation, 4)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
